      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "비가 도통 내리질 않네...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE44AC000020B3C4D1B50020B0B4B9ACC9C80020C54AB124002E002E002E00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "비가 주룩주룩...\n아주 완벽한 날씨인걸!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE44AC000020C8FCB8E9C8FCB8E9002E002E002E000AC544C8FC0020C644BCBDD55C0020B0A0C528C778AC78002100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너 말이야, 포켓몬 승부에서\n날씨를 신경 써 본 적 있어?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B1080020B9D0C774C57C002C0020D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80C5D0C11C000AB0A0C528B97C0020C2E0ACBD0020C3680020BCF80020C8010020C788C5B4003F00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 포켓몬들은\n비가 내리면 강해진다구!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C740000ABE44AC000020B0B4B9ACBA740020AC15D574C9C4B2E4AD6C002100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "비가 내리면 나랑 승부하자.\n진짜 실력을 보여 줄게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE44AC000020B0B4B9ACBA740020B098B7910020C2B9BD80D558C790002E000AC9C4C9DC0020C2E4B825C7440020BCF4C5EC0020C904AC8C002100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "비가 그치기 전에 나랑 승부하자.\n진짜 실력을 보여 줄게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE44AC000020ADF8CE58AE300020C804C5D00020B098B7910020C2B9BD80D558C790002E000AC9C4C9DC0020C2E4B825C7440020BCF4C5EC0020C904AC8C002100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "빗속에서의 승부!\n준비가 되면 내게 말을 걸어 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE57C18DC5D0C11CC7580020C2B9BD800021000AC900BE44AC000020B418BA740020B0B4AC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C918002100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 포켓몬들의 멋진 모습을 보여 줄 테니까\n비가 내리면 나랑 승부하자!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n...음?\n설마 비가 내릴 때까지 기다리려는 거야?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다릴 거예요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B9B40020AC70C608C694002100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다리진 않을 거예요<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B9ACC9C40020C54AC7440020AC70C608C69400100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "비가 내리는 동안 승부하자.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n내 포켓몬들의\n멋진 모습을 보여 줄게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE44AC000020B0B4B9ACB2940020B3D9C5480020C2B9BD80D558C790002E00100001BE01000AB0B40020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C758000ABA4BC9C40020BAA8C2B5C7440020BCF4C5EC0020C904AC8C002100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "보여 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCF4C5EC0020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "비에 젖으니까 싫어요<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE44C5D00020C816C73CB2C8AE4C0020C2EBC5B4C69400100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇구나...\n그럴 것 같았어...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807AD6CB098002E002E002E000AADF8B7F40020AC830020AC19C558C5B4002E002E002E00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐!? 이러다간 비가 그쳐 버린다구!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB500021003F0020C774B7ECB2E4AC040020BE44AC000020ADF8CCD00020BC84B9B0B2E4AD6C002100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐!? 나랑 그렇게 승부가 하고 싶은 거야!?\n그럼, 같이 비를 기다리자...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB500021003F0020B098B7910020ADF8B807AC8C0020C2B9BD80AC000020D558ACE00020C2F6C7400020AC70C57C0021003F000AADF8B7FC002C0020AC19C7740020BE44B97C0020AE30B2E4B9ACC790002E002E002E00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "비야! 비가 내리고 있어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE44C57C00210020BE44AC000020B0B4B9ACACE00020C788C5B4002100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "비가 내리면 내 포켓몬의 기술은 최강이야!\n물타입과 비의 환상적인 조합을 보여 줄게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE44AC000020B0B4B9ACBA740020B0B40020D3ECCF13BAACC7580020AE30C220C7400020CD5CAC15C774C57C0021000ABB3CD0C0C785ACFC0020BE44C7580020D658C0C1C801C7780020C870D569C7440020BCF4C5EC0020C904AC8C002100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "물타입과 비의 환상적인 조합으로도\n이기지 못하다니...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB3CD0C0C785ACFC0020BE44C7580020D658C0C1C801C7780020C870D569C73CB85CB3C4000AC774AE30C9C00020BABBD558B2E4B2C8002E002E002E00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 포켓몬들이 전부\n물타입 기술을 배우고 있었지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C7740020C804BD80000ABB3CD0C0C7850020AE30C220C7440020BC30C6B0ACE00020C788C5C8C9C0003F00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "물타입 기술은 비가 내리면 강해지거든!\n그래서 이길 수 있을 줄 알았는데...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB3CD0C0C7850020AE30C220C7400020BE44AC000020B0B4B9ACBA740020AC15D574C9C0AC70B4E00021000AADF8B798C11C0020C774AE380020C2180020C788C7440020C9040020C54CC558B294B370002E002E002E00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "참고로...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CC38ACE0B85C002E002E002E00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "불꽃타입 기술은 약해지게 돼.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD88AF43D0C0C7850020AE30C220C7400020C57DD574C9C0AC8C0020B3FC002E00100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "비에 젖으면 잘 타지 않으니까\n당연한 일이지만 말이야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE44C5D00020C816C73CBA740020C7980020D0C0C9C00020C54AC73CB2C8AE4C000AB2F9C5F0D55C0020C77CC774C9C0B9CC0020B9D0C774C57C002100100002011401490000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
